      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Honestly the whole nameplate system needs an overhaul because it sucks. I never understood the reason why we can pretend to be a \"user\" if where known+. Really whats the point? It adds nothing meaningful to the game. Not to mention Its awfully annoying to have to change settings on 5 different classes of players to get the actual desired effect the system should have been; public user options.\nPersonally I want a option to use text only names and scale them to whatever size I want to reduce screen clutter. Also why not let people upload their own custom nameplate.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
