      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The whole \"Rank\" system is useless and only creates a stigma for people who don't fit into their groups, i.e. Users vs Trusted, etc. The whole system needs shelved and put back the way it was, give us proper settings for shaders and particles instead.",
      "viewerReactions": null
