      "value": "@{5dd5b4b4cb0e117f2e7bab81|full_name}: vrc actually cracked down on people using that vanity nameplate prefab \nIt was a thing where you could customize a texture of a blank nametag and put it in the prefab and put it on your avatar. The customized tag will overrender the original tag but not the info on the tag. A harmless fun thing but vrc doesn't like it because it \"interferes with muh precious trust rank colors\".",
      "viewerReactions": null
